<p>In the beginning, there was . looked deep into it’s own nature, and saw an infinite ocean. looked at the edges of the infinite ocean, and saw waves smashing forever against cliffs and boulders. stood on the edge of a sea cliff, and gazed to the horizon. Stars twinkled. There was no moon. In the dark, the ocean was audible but invisible. A stiff breeze chilled . Hair and clothing flapped in the wind.</p>

<p>Ravenna slapped her phone to silence the alarm. Fuck. She’d been dreaming something good, but she couldn’t remember what. She went downstairs to the kitchen, still in her pajamas.</p>

