<p>“Congratulations,” said the principal without emotion. He handed her a big shiny envelope, with the school colors. “We’re all very proud of you.”</p>

<p>As she returned to her seat, she started a timer for one week, left it counting down, superimposed on a corner of her vision. One week. One week to find a new home.</p>

