<h2 id="3-hello-hilo">3: Hello Hilo</h2>

<p>Ravenna tossed her keys on the couch.</p>

<p>“I’m glad you’re home!” Charlie bounded up to her excitedly like a dog. “I missed you.” He was shaved, sober, nice-smelling, had a modern haircut. She’d even started him on lessons in empathic listening.</p>

